────────────────────\n│\n│\n│\n│\n│  ▌\n│  ▌\n│  ▌    ┌────────────────┐     ┌───────────────┐    ┌───────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐\n│  ▌    │                │     │               │    │               │    │              │\n│  ▌    │  ────────────  │─────│  ───────────  │────│─  ─────────   │────│─  ─────────  │\n│  ▌    └────────────────┘     └───────────────┘    │               │    └──────────────┘\n│  ▌                                                └───────────────┘       ─\"HELLO\\n\"\n│  ▌\n│  ▌\n│\n│        ┌──────────────────────────────┐               ┌──────────────────────────────┐\n│        │ Original shell               │               │Returned shell                │\n│        │▌                             │               │                              │\n│        │▌files                   none │               │files              shout.txt  │\n│        │▌                             │               ▌                              │\n│        │ steps run                  0 │               ▌shout.txt          \"HELLO\\n\"  │\n│        │                              │               ▌                              │\n│        └──────────────────────────────┘               │steps run                  2  │\n│                                                       │stdout                    \"\"  │\n│                                                       │                              │\n│                                                       └──────────────────────────────┘\n│"},{"step":"lookup","title":"The model runs echo, tr and cat and refuses ls","line":"A name with no branch falls to the last line and throws.","caption":"Exec dispatches on the command name: echo, tr and cat each have a branch, and any other name, such as ls, falls through to the last line and throws “Unknown model command”.","start":46.9,"end":58.9,"hold":54,"state":{"oldShell":{"fs":{},"steps":0},"newShell":{"fs":{"shout.txt":"HELLO\n"},"steps":2},"stdout":"","walks":[{"step":"redu