───┘   └─────────────────┘  ─││   ────────────   │\n│            ▌                                         └───│┘                  │\n│            ▌                                             └───────────────────┘\n│            ▌                                                      ls\n│            ▌\n│\n│\n│                       ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                       │                                               │\n│                       │ if (name === \"echo\") …                        │\n│                       │ else if (name === \"tr\") …                     │\n│                       │ else if (name === \"cat\") …                    │\n│                       ▌                                               │\n│                       ▌ else throw Error(\"Unknown model command\")     │\n│                       └───────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n│\n│"},{"step":"cat","title":"cat reads the original shell","line":"The original shell has no shout.txt, so cat prints nothing.","caption":"Cat receives the original shell, which has no shout.txt, so this model prints nothing. The earlier exec wrote HELLO into a copy and left this value as it was.","start":58.9,"end":69.8,"hold":61.533,"state":{"oldShell":{"fs":{},"steps":0},"newShell":{"fs":{"shout.txt":"HELLO\n"},"steps":2},"stdout":"","walks":[{"step":"reduce","from":"Input","to":"Echo","edge":"edge:Input->Echo#0"},{"step":"reduce","from":"Echo","to":"Tr","edge":"edge:Echo->Tr#0"},{"step":"reduce","from":"Tr","to":"Output","edge":"edge:Tr->Output#0"},{"step":"lookup","from":"Name","to":"Builtin","edge":"edge:Name->Builtin#0"},{"step":"lookup","from":"Builtin","to":"Run","edge":"edge:Builtin->Run#0"},{"step":"lookup","from":"Builtin","to":"Error","edge":"edge:Builtin->Error#0"}],"cat":""},"changed":{"cat":{"after":""}},"picture":"Code, 1 line; “Original shell”, 3 labelled values; “Returned shell”, 3 labelled values. Marked: cat stdout: \"\".","drawing":"┌─────────